{"id":"a3421dd0a360a650","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-pv-function.md","title":"PV Function","display":"df-pv-function — PV Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-pv-function","aliases":["92-df-pv-function"],"display":"df-pv-function — PV Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-pv-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-pv-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pv-function — PV Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity and total function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (fixed effective enumeration of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-ary partial recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}^{(k)}_e(\\vec x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}^{(k)}_e(\\vec x)\\)</span> (running time when program <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> halts in a fixed deterministic machine model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_k(\\vec x)\">\\(\\ell_k(\\vec x)\\)</span> (total binary input length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poly}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poly}\\)</span> (polynomial class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PV}\">\\(\\mathrm{PV}\\)</span> (definition-target polynomial-time function predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pv\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\ell(0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\ell(n)\\coloneqq1+\\lfloor\\log_2 n\\rfloor\\quad(n&gt;0),\\qquad\n\\ell_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^k\\ell(x_i),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PV}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Poly}\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\mathbin{\\downarrow}=f(\\vec x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Time}^{(k)}_e(\\vec x)\\leq p(\\ell_k(\\vec x))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pv\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\ell(0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\ell(n)\\coloneqq1+\\lfloor\\log_2 n\\rfloor\\quad(n&gt;0),\\qquad\n\\ell_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^k\\ell(x_i),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PV}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Poly}\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\mathbin{\\downarrow}=f(\\vec x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Time}^{(k)}_e(\\vec x)\\leq p(\\ell_k(\\vec x))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PV函数：多项式时间可计算</li>\n<li>在多项式时间内完成</li>\n<li>在固定的合理机器与二进制编码之间，定义只相差多项式模拟，因而是稳健的</li>\n<li>数值 PV 函数是 PR 函数的一个子类，但“可行”的哲学解释不是定义的一部分</li>\n<li>语言的多项式时间可判定集合构成复杂度类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>；它与数值函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PV}\">\\(\\mathrm{PV}\\)</span> 不是同一个有类型对象</li>\n<li>有界算术与 PV 的精确对应取决于所选理论、语言和“可定义/可证明全”这一口径，不能无条件写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1_2=\\mathrm{PV}\">\\(S^1_2=\\mathrm{PV}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed effective enumeration of $k$-ary partial recursive functions, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Time}^{(k)}_e(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_k(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poly}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pv\\text{-}function}\\vdash{}&\n\\ell(0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\ell(n)\\coloneqq1+\\lfloor\\log_2 n\\rfloor\\quad(n>0),\\qquad\n\\ell_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^k\\ell(x_i),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{PV}(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists p\\in\\mathrm{Poly}\\;\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\mathbin{\\downarrow}=f(\\vec x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Time}^{(k)}_e(\\vec x)\\leq p(\\ell_k(\\vec x))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"S^1_2=\\mathrm{PV}","display":false}],"bytes":1835,"backlinks":[{"id":"e29ed1961d4b73a9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PV}$ (polynomial-time function predicate, see [[92-df-pv-function]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md]]\n[[92-df-expression.md]]\n[[92-df-extension-theory.md]]\n[[92-df-feasible-mathematics.md]]\n[[92-df-final-count.md]]\n[[92-df-final-summary.md]]\n[[92-df-forcing.md]]\n[[92-df-formal-system.md]]\n[[92-df-formula-formation.md]]\n[[92-df-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-free-variable-function.md]]\n[[92-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[92-df-g-system.md]]\n[[92-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[92-df-godel-encoding-details.md]]\n[[92-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[92-df-godel-pairing.md]]\n[[92-df-godel-sentence.md]]